              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasira yangu imewaka juu ya wachungaji, nami nitawaadhibu mbuzi waume; kwa maana BWANA wa majeshi ameliangalia kundi lake, yaani, nyumba ya Yuda, naye atawafanya kuwa kama farasi wake mzuri vitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.22.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 22:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwake yeye litatoka lile jiwe la pembeni, kwake yeye utatoka msumari, kwake yeye utatoka upinde wa vita, kwake yeye atatoka kila mtawala pamoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao watakuwa kama mashujaa, wakanyagao adui zao katika matope ya njia vitani; nao watapiga vita, kwa sababu BWANA yu pamoja nao; na hao wapandao farasi watafadhaishwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nitaitia nguvu nyumba ya Yuda, nami nitaiokoa nyumba ya Yusufu, nami nitawarudisha, kwa maana nawaonea rehema; nao watakuwa kana kwamba sikuwatupa; kwa maana mimi ni BWANA, Mungu wao, nami nitawasikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na watu wa Efraimu watakuwa kama shujaa, na moyo wao utafurahi kana kwamba ni kwa divai; naam, watoto wao wataona mambo haya, na kufurahi; mioyo yao itamfurahia BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.5.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 5:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitawapigia kelele, na kuwakusanya pamoja; kwa maana nimewakomboa; nao wataongezeka kama walivyoongezeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nitawapanda kama mbegu kati ya mataifa; nao watanikumbuka katika nchi zilizo mbali; nao watakaa pamoja na watoto wao; tena watarudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
